    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Kindly Note : \ni) Viewings strictly by appointment. **To schedule a viewing** contact Lubna Phone: +353 871861961 | E-mail: lubfroehlich @ proton.me\nii) To see current offers and/or to submit a formal offer: www.swiftly.ie website -> the property listing -> follow the steps.\n\n---\n\nSwiftly is delighted to bring to market Apartment 4A, The Glen, Bettyglen, Raheny, Dublin 5.\n\nNestled in the heart of one of North Dublin's most sought-after residential locations, Apartment 4A, The Glen offers a wonderful opportunity to acquire a bright and well-positioned one-bedroom apartment with an exceptional south-west facing aspect. The property is freshly renovated and painted with new flooring added. The previous owner was the sole owner and the property has never been registered with the RTB.\n\nOne of the property's standout features is its peaceful outlook over mature trees to the rear, with no overlooking neighbours, creating a rare sense of privacy and tranquillity. The south-west orientation fills the apartment with natural light throughout the day, while the sounds of birdsong and surrounding greenery provide a truly relaxing setting.\n\nPerfectly suited to first-time buyers, those looking to downsize, or investors, this apartment combines comfortable living with an unbeatable location.\n\nThe Glen enjoys an enviable position opposite Bull Island, Dollymount Strand and the magnificent St. Anne's Park, offering endless opportunities for walking, running, cycling and enjoying Dublin Bay's spectacular coastline. Raheny Village is just a short stroll away, providing an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, shops, supermarkets and everyday amenities.\n\nCommuting couldn't be easier, with Raheny DART Station within walking distance and multiple Dublin Bus routes serving the area, providing quick and convenient access to Dublin City Centre. The M50, M1 and Dublin Airport are all easily accessible, making this a strategically positioned address for both city and nationwide travel.\n\nThe property also benefits from being within the catchment area of an excellent selection of highly regarded primary and secondary schools, further enhancing its appeal.\n\nWhether you're searching for your first home, a peaceful place to downsize, or a superb investment in a mature and established neighbourhood, Apartment 4A offers an outstanding combination of lifestyle, convenience and location."
      },
